# PITFALLS.md

This document lists known repository traps, assumptions, and failure points.

Read when:

- behavior seems inconsistent
- modifying architecture
- editing prompts
- changing portfolio assumptions
- debugging unusual behavior

---

# Deprecated Components

## app.py

Status:

```text
DEPRECATED
```

Do NOT edit.

Do NOT run.

Reason:

Flask implementation is abandoned.

Correct backend:

```text
serve.ps1
```

---

## start.bat

Status:

```text
DEPRECATED
```

Do NOT use.

Reason:

Starts deprecated Flask app.

Correct startup:

```powershell
powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File portfolio\serve.ps1
```

